  "id": "es_cb",
  "title": "Spain Cantabria Crop fields",
  "description": "SIGPAC Crop fields of Spain - Cantabria\n\nThis collection holds 16 editions (2010, 2011, 2012, 2013, 2014, 2015, 2016, 2017, 2018, 2019, 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024, 2025), one GeoParquet file per year under `year=<year>/` (hive layout). Read them all at once with the partition glob `s3://ftw/harmonized-field-data/es_cb/year=*/*.parquet` (S3 through the Source Cooperative proxy, endpoint `https://data.source.coop`; plain https cannot expand `*`); the `data` asset is a copy of the latest edition (2025). Geometries are kept in the source CRS (EPSG:4326). Converted with [fiboa-cli](https://github.com/fiboa/cli) into the [fiboa](https://github.com/fiboa/specification) schema; tested queries are in the collection's [AGENTS.md](https://source.coop/ftw/harmonized-field-data/es_cb/AGENTS.md).\n\nBoundaries are declared: they come from farmers' subsidy applications, or from the parcel register built on those declarations.",
  "boundaries": "declared",
  "keywords": [
    "Cantabria",
    "Spain",
    "agriculture",
    "crop fields",
    "fiboa",
    "field boundaries"
  ],
  "license": "other",
